te this step-by-step.\n\n8. **Final Calculation:**\n   - Using the final step:\n     \\[\n     \\text{Distance} \\approx \\frac{\\pi \\cdot 9}{2} \\cdot 2\n     \\]\n   - Simplifying this:\n     \\[\n     \\text{Distance} \\approx \\frac{72\\pi}{10}\n     \\]\n     \\[\n     \\approx 72 \\cdot 0.3142\n     \\]\n     \\[\n     \\approx 22\n     \\]\n\n**Final Answer:** \\boxed{72}",
